---
description: Hard security rules for payment / money-path code
globs: **/payments/**,**/payment/**,**/billing/**,**/webhook*/**,**/checkout/**,**/razorpay/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- DETERMINISTIC CODE ONLY: no LLM calls, no AI/ML inference, no probabilistic logic in these paths.
- PSP (Razorpay) clients initialize in TEST mode only; key id/secret come from env vars only.
- Verify webhook signatures (Razorpay X-Razorpay-Signature HMAC) BEFORE processing any payload; reject mismatches with 400.
- Money amounts are integer paise/cents — never floats; never string-format currency.
- Every write is idempotent: dedupe on provider event id / order id; duplicate events return 2xx without side effects.
- Log transaction ids and outcomes only — never raw payloads, keys, or customer PII.
- Any change here requires tests for the happy path AND failure paths (bad signature, duplicate event, amount mismatch).
